[h1]Remote Campfire[/h1]
[b]Check and refill your campfires from one small panel.[/b]

[list]
[*]See fuel levels, with color warnings when fuel runs low.
[*]Refill one campfire or all listed campfires using your wood.
[*]Drag the panel and hide or show it with the campfire icon.
[*]Works while paused; stays hidden in menus.
[/list]

[h2]Getting started[/h2]
Subscribe, let Steam download the mod, then restart the game. Click the campfire icon to open the list. Use either a Workshop copy or a local installation, never both.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[b]Windows, Whiskerwood 0.7.209.0.[/b] Refilling is disabled on other game versions.

Requires wood in a player-accessible granary; cloud-only wood is not supported. Refilling is manual. Panel position lasts for the current session only. The current interface is in German.

[h2]How refilling works[/h2]
The modkit does not expose the campfire's refill action. The mod deducts wood through an existing game resource operation, checks the debit, then adds fuel. No runtime DLL is required.

[url=https://github.com/repte/whiskerwood-remote-campfire]Source, implementation and feedback on GitHub[/url]

[h2]Credits[/h2]
